# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> (lacks parts or has fewer parts of type)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PATOC:CJM") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> "The bearer of this quality has_part < n of the indicated entity type, where n is the normal amount for a comparable organism. Note that the bearer of the quality is the whole, not the part. Formally: If a bearer entity e has fewer parts of type X at time t, then the number of instances x of X at t such that x part_of e is < n, where n is either the normal number for comparable entities, or n is stated explicitly. This case includes the limit case, where the bearer lacks all parts of the specified type.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> "loss of")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> "quality")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> "PATO:0001999")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pato#relational_slim>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> "lacks parts or has fewer parts of type")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002083>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> (lacks all parts of type)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PATOC:CJM") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "A quality of physical entities inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's lacking a physical part as specified by the additional entity.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasAlternativeId> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "PATO:0001557")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "OBO_REL:lacks_part")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "lacks all physical parts of type")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "quality")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "PATO:0002000")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pato#relational_slim>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "Example: [E=organism Q=lacks_all_parts_of_type E2=Wing] - applies to an organism. A relational quality in which the bearer entity has no parts of the specified type. The bearer of this quality has_part = 0 of the indicated entity type, where a comparable organism usually has at least 1 part of the same type. Note that the bearer of the quality is the whole, not the part. Formally: If a bearer entity e lacks all parts of type X at time t, then there exists no instances x of X at t such that x part_of e that has no wings, where wings are normally present in that organism type. In OWL this is equivalent to a restriction on the OBO_REL:has_part relation with cardinality=0, i.e has_part 0 E2.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> "lacks all parts of type")
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002000> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0015012> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000462>))

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> (has fewer parts of type)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PATOC:CJM") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "The bearer of this quality has_part < n AND has_part > 0 of the indicated entity type, where n is the normal amount for a comparable organism. Note that the bearer of the quality is the whole, not the part. Formally: If a bearer entity e has fewer parts of type X at time t, then the number of instances x of X at t such that x part_of e is < n, where n is either the normal number for comparable entities, or n is stated explicitly.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasAlternativeId> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "PATO:0001569")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "decreased number of")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "has decreased number of")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "has fewer physical parts of type")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "quality")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "PATO:0002001")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pato#relational_slim>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "Example: [E=hand Q=has_fewer_parts_of_type E2=digit] - applies to an organism that has no less fingers than is normal for organisms of that type.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> "has fewer parts of type")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0015008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000461>)))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001997>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001999>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002303>)

